1
00:00:16,534 --> 00:00:22,869
(Firefly Theater)

2
00:00:43,456 --> 00:00:47,392
♪Neon lights twist into a knot♪

3
00:00:49,024 --> 00:00:52,608
♪I rest in the ruins of defeat♪

4
00:00:53,184 --> 00:00:55,520
♪You tap your fingers lightly♪

5
00:00:55,904 --> 00:00:58,656
♪I fall into the abyss♪

6
00:00:59,488 --> 00:01:02,080
♪I've seen this game before♪

7
00:01:02,080 --> 00:01:04,768
♪Every single move was calculated♪

8
00:01:04,768 --> 00:01:07,168
♪I finally see your silhouette♪

9
00:01:07,552 --> 00:01:10,304
♪Just an empty shell♪

10
00:01:10,624 --> 00:01:13,440
♪I've broken this game before♪

11
00:01:13,440 --> 00:01:15,872
♪Every move was placed wrong♪

12
00:01:15,872 --> 00:01:18,016
♪Now it's my turn to play♪

13
00:01:18,208 --> 00:01:25,056
♪I'll show you what stunning looks like♪

14
00:01:25,728 --> 00:01:28,256
♪When I stand back up again♪

15
00:01:28,544 --> 00:01:30,400
♪The whole city goes dark♪

16
00:01:31,264 --> 00:01:33,952
♪For the part you owe me♪

17
00:01:34,112 --> 00:01:41,088
♪I'll make you pay double♪

18
00:01:42,624 --> 00:01:47,360
♪You're just my starting point♪

19
00:01:51,712 --> 00:01:52,739
=The Vanishing Beauty=

20
00:01:53,000 --> 00:01:55,720
=Episode 21=

21
00:02:32,619 --> 00:02:34,020
(Sir, please take a look.)

22
00:02:34,459 --> 00:02:36,499
(Ten years ago, Jiangzhou)
I don't want this booklet.

23
00:02:36,860 --> 00:02:37,980
Others give out free eggs.

24
00:02:38,219 --> 00:02:39,059
You give out nothing.

25
00:02:39,899 --> 00:02:41,140
We don't give out eggs here.

26
00:02:42,700 --> 00:02:43,980
Help me file a lawsuit,

27
00:02:43,980 --> 00:02:44,380
okay?

28
00:02:45,219 --> 00:02:46,100
I'm sorry, sir.

29
00:02:46,260 --> 00:02:47,899
I'm just a law freshman.

30
00:02:48,059 --> 00:02:49,100
I am not licensed yet.

31
00:02:49,860 --> 00:02:50,779
I can't file a lawsuit.

32
00:02:51,739 --> 00:02:52,659
You're not licensed?

33
00:02:52,659 --> 00:02:53,939
Then you're not a lawyer!

34
00:02:54,020 --> 00:02:55,380
You're just fooling people!

35
00:02:56,059 --> 00:02:57,020
Listen up, everyone.

36
00:02:57,380 --> 00:02:58,700
These folks are scammers!

37
00:02:59,140 --> 00:03:00,020
Don't listen to them!
Wait, sir.

38
00:03:00,779 --> 00:03:03,020
This is just a legal outreach campaign.

39
00:03:03,100 --> 00:03:03,659
Hello.

40
00:03:04,300 --> 00:03:04,700
Hello.

41
00:03:05,459 --> 00:03:06,820
I'm his college counselor.

42
00:03:07,020 --> 00:03:07,659
I am Weng Xin.

43
00:03:07,899 --> 00:03:08,700
You must be thirsty.
Have some tea.

44
00:03:12,260 --> 00:03:14,420
I heard you wanted to file a lawsuit?

45
00:03:15,420 --> 00:03:15,899
Yeah.

46
00:03:16,459 --> 00:03:17,459
My third brother

47
00:03:17,980 --> 00:03:20,300
is hogging our parents'

48
00:03:20,339 --> 00:03:21,140
house.
He takes it all.

49
00:03:22,939 --> 00:03:23,459
Well,

50
00:03:23,739 --> 00:03:24,779
take a look at this list.

51
00:03:24,899 --> 00:03:25,659
We've compiled

52
00:03:25,739 --> 00:03:27,020
public legal aid organizations

53
00:03:27,100 --> 00:03:28,179
offering consultations.

54
00:03:28,779 --> 00:03:29,860
You can consult them

55
00:03:29,939 --> 00:03:30,659
first,

56
00:03:30,899 --> 00:03:31,700
and then figure out

57
00:03:31,779 --> 00:03:32,820
how to file your lawsuit.

58
00:03:35,100 --> 00:03:37,300
- Happy graduation!
- Happy graduation!

59
00:03:37,300 --> 00:03:40,064
(Six years ago, Jiangzhou)

60
00:03:42,459 --> 00:03:43,179
Have you received
your offers?

61
00:03:44,140 --> 00:03:45,179
Law firms are grueling.

62
00:03:45,540 --> 00:03:46,380
I'm going to apply
for in-house counsel.

63
00:03:47,140 --> 00:03:48,339
A senior told me

64
00:03:48,499 --> 00:03:49,219
we should try

65
00:03:49,300 --> 00:03:50,939
to pivot toward IP law.

66
00:03:51,380 --> 00:03:51,899
It's lucrative.

67
00:03:53,179 --> 00:03:53,820
Jiao Xu,

68
00:03:54,020 --> 00:03:55,059
which firm do you join?

69
00:03:55,339 --> 00:03:56,899
Tell us then.

70
00:03:58,540 --> 00:03:59,219
Yihe.

71
00:03:59,659 --> 00:04:00,619
It held a seminar

72
00:04:00,700 --> 00:04:01,459
yesterday.

73
00:04:01,820 --> 00:04:02,779
Wasn't that firm founded
just last year?

74
00:04:03,820 --> 00:04:05,020
The founder said they're small

75
00:04:05,059 --> 00:04:06,059
and still starting out.

76
00:04:06,420 --> 00:04:06,939
Jiao Xu,

77
00:04:07,020 --> 00:04:08,179
are you out of your mind?

78
00:04:08,459 --> 00:04:09,659
So many elite firms

79
00:04:09,739 --> 00:04:10,700
are wide open for you.

80
00:04:10,980 --> 00:04:11,820
With your skills,

81
00:04:12,420 --> 00:04:13,339
doing transactional law

82
00:04:13,860 --> 00:04:14,540
and IPOs

83
00:04:14,739 --> 00:04:15,659
can make you a fortune.

84
00:04:18,020 --> 00:04:19,260
Compared to an elite firm,

85
00:04:19,380 --> 00:04:20,620
I'd rather join a new platform

86
00:04:20,659 --> 00:04:21,659
and grow wildly.

87
00:04:22,180 --> 00:04:23,419
I talked to the founder

88
00:04:23,500 --> 00:04:24,659
and felt it's a great fit.

89
00:04:24,859 --> 00:04:26,779
So why not build something together?

90
00:04:27,419 --> 00:04:29,299
Don't trust their empty promises.

91
00:04:29,940 --> 00:04:30,419
Miss Weng,

92
00:04:30,500 --> 00:04:32,020
talk some sense into him.

93
00:04:32,380 --> 00:04:33,820
Why turn down an offer

94
00:04:33,940 --> 00:04:34,979
with a million salary?

95
00:04:35,299 --> 00:04:35,899
I believe

96
00:04:36,620 --> 00:04:37,659
with his capabilities,

97
00:04:38,020 --> 00:04:38,979
wherever he goes,

98
00:04:39,500 --> 00:04:40,620
he'll earn more than that.

99
00:04:41,580 --> 00:04:41,979
Jiao Xu,

100
00:04:42,380 --> 00:04:43,180
I have faith in you.

101
00:05:05,461 --> 00:05:08,410
(Couple, Best Friend, Chairman, Parents)

102
00:05:27,940 --> 00:05:29,539
I thought you held me back that day

103
00:05:29,859 --> 00:05:30,859
to stop me.

104
00:05:32,260 --> 00:05:33,140
What I meant was,

105
00:05:33,419 --> 00:05:34,659
after hearing what you said,

106
00:05:34,659 --> 00:05:35,459
Weng Yue reacted so intensely.

107
00:05:35,820 --> 00:05:36,979
There's no need to try to

108
00:05:37,060 --> 00:05:37,740
convince her.

109
00:05:38,260 --> 00:05:40,299
Better to speak directly to Weng Xin.

110
00:05:42,020 --> 00:05:44,299
I didn't expect Weng Xin
to have a law background.

111
00:05:45,099 --> 00:05:46,099
I thought you lawyers
were tough enough

112
00:05:47,260 --> 00:05:48,539
to defend your own rights

113
00:05:48,940 --> 00:05:49,779
from getting harmed.

114
00:05:50,859 --> 00:05:52,020
She had great grades.

115
00:05:52,500 --> 00:05:53,539
All her classmates thought

116
00:05:53,580 --> 00:05:54,339
she'd join a firm.

117
00:05:54,659 --> 00:05:55,339
But she

118
00:05:55,820 --> 00:05:57,060
stayed as a college counselor.

119
00:06:08,380 --> 00:06:08,979
Weng Xin.

120
00:06:10,500 --> 00:06:10,979
Weng Xin.

121
00:06:12,260 --> 00:06:13,020
You know her?

122
00:06:15,260 --> 00:06:15,700
Hello.

123
00:06:16,500 --> 00:06:17,419
I'm Weng Yue's friend.

124
00:06:18,140 --> 00:06:19,979
I met Xin at the hospital before.

125
00:06:27,740 --> 00:06:28,419
Weng Xin,

126
00:06:29,659 --> 00:06:30,380
you recognized me?

127
00:06:34,459 --> 00:06:35,779
Has her condition

128
00:06:36,099 --> 00:06:36,659
improved?

129
00:06:37,899 --> 00:06:38,539
Same as usual.

130
00:06:39,140 --> 00:06:40,339
An episode just passed,

131
00:06:40,740 --> 00:06:42,820
so she's slowly stabilizing now.

132
00:06:43,339 --> 00:06:44,459
But she doesn't remember

133
00:06:44,500 --> 00:06:45,299
anything
she did earlier.

134
00:06:47,020 --> 00:06:48,099
She looks fine right now,

135
00:06:48,859 --> 00:06:49,940
but when an episode hits,

136
00:06:51,779 --> 00:06:52,500
it's really...

137
00:07:13,500 --> 00:07:13,820
Dad,

138
00:07:14,339 --> 00:07:14,940
what happened?

139
00:07:15,779 --> 00:07:16,539
An episode hits.

140
00:07:17,459 --> 00:07:18,299
Guang is with her.

141
00:07:19,539 --> 00:07:20,180
It's okay.

142
00:07:20,620 --> 00:07:21,979
Don't be afraid.

143
00:07:22,500 --> 00:07:22,820
Be good.

144
00:07:23,459 --> 00:07:24,060
Sleep now.

145
00:07:24,820 --> 00:07:25,339
I'm here.

146
00:07:33,820 --> 00:07:34,659
How is Xin?

147
00:07:35,940 --> 00:07:36,779
I finally managed
to get her to sleep.

148
00:07:37,859 --> 00:07:38,580
Don't go in.
You'd wake her.

149
00:07:39,979 --> 00:07:41,060
Get some iodine

150
00:07:41,219 --> 00:07:41,979
for his wounds.

151
00:07:42,620 --> 00:07:42,940
Okay.
No need.

152
00:07:44,740 --> 00:07:45,659
I have thick skin.

153
00:07:45,779 --> 00:07:47,419
It's just like a cat scratch.

154
00:07:47,820 --> 00:07:48,299
I'm fine.

155
00:07:49,299 --> 00:07:49,740
By the way,

156
00:07:50,260 --> 00:07:51,140
you said you met

157
00:07:51,219 --> 00:07:53,020
Xin's friends in the park.

158
00:07:53,260 --> 00:07:53,940
Who are they?

159
00:07:55,219 --> 00:07:56,180
I don't know them.

160
00:07:56,539 --> 00:07:57,299
A man and a woman.

161
00:07:57,620 --> 00:07:58,459
But Miss Weng

162
00:07:58,580 --> 00:07:59,539
recognized the woman.

163
00:08:01,140 --> 00:08:01,419
Yeah.

164
00:08:01,940 --> 00:08:02,659
She said

165
00:08:02,859 --> 00:08:04,020
she's Weng Yue's friend.

166
00:08:06,180 --> 00:08:07,060
My friend?

167
00:08:07,940 --> 00:08:08,820
I wonder what she

168
00:08:08,940 --> 00:08:10,260
said to Xin.

169
00:08:10,779 --> 00:08:12,140
Her episode had just ended,

170
00:08:12,940 --> 00:08:14,020
so it shouldn't have...

171
00:08:14,459 --> 00:08:15,740
It's all my fault.

172
00:08:16,459 --> 00:08:16,859
I should

173
00:08:16,979 --> 00:08:18,140
spend more time with her

174
00:08:18,500 --> 00:08:19,500
and watch over her.

175
00:08:19,979 --> 00:08:21,099
None of us wants

176
00:08:21,419 --> 00:08:23,099
to see Xin like this.

177
00:08:24,260 --> 00:08:25,620
You've already done so much.

178
00:08:26,260 --> 00:08:27,299
You talk to her

179
00:08:27,459 --> 00:08:28,260
every day,

180
00:08:28,820 --> 00:08:29,899
and never lose your temper.

181
00:08:31,459 --> 00:08:32,939
You're the pillar of this family.

182
00:08:33,500 --> 00:08:34,419
Stay strong.

183
00:08:34,819 --> 00:08:35,860
Don't get depressed.

184
00:08:37,100 --> 00:08:37,899
Don't worry, Dad.

185
00:08:38,579 --> 00:08:40,380
Even if the rest of the world
get depressed,

186
00:08:40,500 --> 00:08:41,299
I never will.

187
00:08:42,220 --> 00:08:44,059
I have to help Xin recover.

188
00:08:47,539 --> 00:08:48,059
Let me do it.

189
00:08:58,740 --> 00:08:59,299
Xin,

190
00:09:01,380 --> 00:09:02,419
I often think

191
00:09:03,579 --> 00:09:05,059
of the day we first met.

192
00:09:06,340 --> 00:09:06,899
At that time,

193
00:09:07,899 --> 00:09:08,659
I was just

194
00:09:08,740 --> 00:09:10,020
a contractor of door frames.

195
00:09:11,140 --> 00:09:12,539
Your villa was being renovated,

196
00:09:13,899 --> 00:09:15,220
and I came to take measurements.

197
00:09:18,779 --> 00:09:19,860
I loved you at first sight.

198
00:09:23,579 --> 00:09:24,939
Your dad shopped around

199
00:09:25,419 --> 00:09:26,140
and thought

200
00:09:27,340 --> 00:09:29,659
my prices were honest and reasonable.

201
00:09:30,539 --> 00:09:31,699
He tested me over and over.

202
00:09:34,260 --> 00:09:34,860
Later on,

203
00:09:36,340 --> 00:09:37,579
before the renovation finished,

204
00:09:38,699 --> 00:09:39,860
your dad invited me

205
00:09:40,100 --> 00:09:41,500
to work at your family's company.

206
00:09:45,659 --> 00:09:46,500
Although

207
00:09:47,819 --> 00:09:48,899
I'm just a rough guy,

208
00:09:51,419 --> 00:09:52,340
I can't help

209
00:09:52,340 --> 00:09:53,899
saying something cheesy.

210
00:09:54,699 --> 00:09:55,699
Meeting you

211
00:09:57,020 --> 00:09:58,819
was truly the luckiest thing

212
00:10:01,740 --> 00:10:02,939
in my entire life.

213
00:10:33,579 --> 00:10:34,260
I have photos

214
00:10:34,380 --> 00:10:35,659
of Han Guang and Weng Xin.

215
00:10:35,779 --> 00:10:36,779
I'll distract the caregiver,

216
00:10:36,899 --> 00:10:38,020
and you'll find the chance

217
00:10:38,140 --> 00:10:39,340
to talk to Weng Xin

218
00:10:40,100 --> 00:10:41,500
about her past

219
00:10:41,539 --> 00:10:42,140
with Han Guang.

220
00:10:46,059 --> 00:10:47,059
You have photos of him

221
00:10:47,340 --> 00:10:48,579
from his contractor days?

222
00:10:49,220 --> 00:10:50,460
He never hid that part.

223
00:10:50,939 --> 00:10:52,419
It's his way of getting close

224
00:10:52,419 --> 00:10:53,059
to people.

225
00:10:54,020 --> 00:10:55,260
He even criticized

226
00:10:55,260 --> 00:10:56,340
Jiali's doors and windows,

227
00:10:56,460 --> 00:10:57,419
letting you change them.

228
00:10:59,579 --> 00:10:59,980
She's here.

229
00:11:00,980 --> 00:11:01,699
I told you two

230
00:11:01,779 --> 00:11:03,299
to mind your own business.

231
00:11:04,299 --> 00:11:04,699
Yu Meng,

232
00:11:05,380 --> 00:11:05,939
how about
your own mess?

233
00:11:07,260 --> 00:11:08,059
Aren't you divorcing
Di Liren?

234
00:11:09,380 --> 00:11:10,179
Why meddling in

235
00:11:10,260 --> 00:11:11,539
my family's affairs?

236
00:11:16,380 --> 00:11:17,179
Actually,

237
00:11:17,620 --> 00:11:18,939
I did it for my divorce.

238
00:11:20,179 --> 00:11:21,340
Want to hear

239
00:11:21,659 --> 00:11:22,419
a story?

240
00:11:28,500 --> 00:11:29,620
So you suspect

241
00:11:30,380 --> 00:11:31,340
my sister

242
00:11:32,059 --> 00:11:33,059
was deliberately framed

243
00:11:33,179 --> 00:11:34,260
as mentally ill,

244
00:11:34,260 --> 00:11:35,020
just like you?

245
00:11:35,620 --> 00:11:36,380
Haven't you

246
00:11:36,860 --> 00:11:37,779
ever suspected it?

247
00:11:42,860 --> 00:11:43,299
Yes.

248
00:11:45,299 --> 00:11:46,299
I asked my dad once.

249
00:11:48,179 --> 00:11:49,220
But without proof,

250
00:11:49,659 --> 00:11:51,059
it would only arouse suspicion

251
00:11:51,299 --> 00:11:52,100
and alert Han Guang.

252
00:11:52,579 --> 00:11:53,460
That's why

253
00:11:54,020 --> 00:11:54,819
I've been trying
to get inside the company.

254
00:11:56,579 --> 00:11:57,380
Our family business
can't be into his hands.

255
00:12:00,860 --> 00:12:02,299
Han Guang is our common enemy.

256
00:12:02,939 --> 00:12:03,899
You mean...

257
00:12:04,340 --> 00:12:05,260
I want to use Han Guang

258
00:12:05,500 --> 00:12:06,220
to keep Di Liren in check.

259
00:12:06,939 --> 00:12:07,659
I think

260
00:12:08,299 --> 00:12:09,059
we can cooperate.

261
00:12:11,299 --> 00:12:13,220
I might not help you much.

262
00:12:14,100 --> 00:12:15,100
At Yaoyan,
I don't hold real power.

263
00:12:16,899 --> 00:12:18,100
My dad trusts Han Guang.

264
00:12:18,980 --> 00:12:20,260
Han Guang holds no shares,

265
00:12:20,539 --> 00:12:21,419
but as long as
he doesn't

266
00:12:22,299 --> 00:12:23,380
cross the line,

267
00:12:23,980 --> 00:12:24,899
my dad rarely cares.

268
00:12:26,340 --> 00:12:27,380
So,

269
00:12:27,740 --> 00:12:28,899
we must first find

270
00:12:28,980 --> 00:12:29,779
Han Guang's weakness

271
00:12:30,620 --> 00:12:31,460
to bring him down.

272
00:12:32,519 --> 00:12:34,261
(Graduation Photo of Jiangzhou University
Law Department Class of 2018)

273
00:12:45,179 --> 00:12:45,699
Xu,

274
00:12:47,419 --> 00:12:48,819
I have something to ask you.

275
00:12:49,299 --> 00:12:50,340
You don't seem to up

276
00:12:50,500 --> 00:12:51,539
to something good.

277
00:12:52,659 --> 00:12:54,020
But can I ask

278
00:12:54,059 --> 00:12:55,380
why you always come to me?

279
00:12:56,179 --> 00:12:57,059
You're the only one
being honest to me,

280
00:12:58,419 --> 00:12:59,100
willing
to take me

281
00:13:00,179 --> 00:13:00,939
to Meng's place,

282
00:13:01,899 --> 00:13:02,500
and

283
00:13:03,100 --> 00:13:03,860
treating me like a man.

284
00:13:05,340 --> 00:13:06,460
What do you want to know?

285
00:13:06,899 --> 00:13:07,579
I want to know

286
00:13:09,100 --> 00:13:10,140
what my dad did.

287
00:13:15,299 --> 00:13:16,419
I can't tell you that.

288
00:13:17,179 --> 00:13:18,179
Yu Meng and your mom

289
00:13:18,220 --> 00:13:19,059
would kill me.

290
00:13:20,779 --> 00:13:21,579
Just tell me

291
00:13:21,779 --> 00:13:22,699
what I can know,
alright?

292
00:13:30,539 --> 00:13:31,419
I just remembered

293
00:13:31,740 --> 00:13:32,699
I need to go for a bit.

294
