00:24:33,819 --> 00:24:34,539
called Haomeng.

587
00:24:35,180 --> 00:24:35,940
You might not know.

588
00:24:36,420 --> 00:24:36,900
I do.

589
00:24:38,859 --> 00:24:39,940
That product was

590
00:24:40,099 --> 00:24:40,980
discontinued for long.

591
00:24:42,059 --> 00:24:42,740
But when I
browsed a thrift market,

592
00:24:44,339 --> 00:24:45,260
I found that someone

593
00:24:45,819 --> 00:24:46,420
has been trying
to collect this balm

594
00:24:48,379 --> 00:24:49,500
and replicate it.

595
00:24:52,180 --> 00:24:53,460
I never thought

596
00:24:54,379 --> 00:24:55,099
a dream

597
00:24:55,819 --> 00:24:57,059
could be in someone's memory

598
00:24:57,180 --> 00:24:57,859
for so long.

599
00:24:58,379 --> 00:24:59,260
When I open it,

600
00:25:00,579 --> 00:25:01,700
it's the smell of childhood.

601
00:25:04,260 --> 00:25:05,180
You want to remake it?

602
00:25:05,740 --> 00:25:06,099
Exactly.

603
00:25:07,619 --> 00:25:09,099
I want to bring it back.

604
00:25:10,059 --> 00:25:10,859
However,

605
00:25:11,500 --> 00:25:13,379
I want to produce Haomeng 2.0.

606
00:25:14,700 --> 00:25:15,859
I want to express

607
00:25:15,859 --> 00:25:16,660
what it means to me.

608
00:25:21,180 --> 00:25:22,099
Done. Your turn.

609
00:25:23,099 --> 00:25:24,339
What is your dream?

610
00:25:26,460 --> 00:25:27,500
My dream?

611
00:25:31,220 --> 00:25:31,900
Open a small shop

612
00:25:33,579 --> 00:25:34,779
and live a peaceful life.

613
00:25:40,900 --> 00:25:41,779
That's a lovely dream.

614
00:25:42,900 --> 00:25:44,579
It may sound ordinary,

615
00:25:45,139 --> 00:25:45,700
but it's what

616
00:25:45,740 --> 00:25:47,020
many people yearn for.

617
00:25:48,579 --> 00:25:49,020
By the way,

618
00:25:49,700 --> 00:25:50,779
you could go to the UK

619
00:25:50,819 --> 00:25:51,740
to open a clinic.

620
00:25:53,059 --> 00:25:53,579
No way.

621
00:25:53,859 --> 00:25:55,139
You need a medical license.

622
00:25:55,940 --> 00:25:57,420
You could open

623
00:25:57,740 --> 00:25:58,660
a massage center,

624
00:25:59,579 --> 00:26:00,059
to do moxibustion.

625
00:26:00,700 --> 00:26:01,859
A lot of people

626
00:26:02,099 --> 00:26:03,220
open those abroad now.

627
00:26:03,420 --> 00:26:04,180
Good business.

628
00:26:05,420 --> 00:26:07,020
But that's physical labor.

629
00:26:07,420 --> 00:26:08,500
Might be pretty exhausting.

630
00:26:09,660 --> 00:26:10,740
Every job is exhausting.

631
00:26:11,660 --> 00:26:13,059
My dad always said that.

632
00:26:13,779 --> 00:26:14,700
Your dad was right.

633
00:26:15,500 --> 00:26:16,660
If you don't work hard,

634
00:26:16,980 --> 00:26:18,099
your mind suffers.

635
00:26:18,379 --> 00:26:20,139
When my dad went to school,

636
00:26:21,180 --> 00:26:22,619
he left home at 4:30 AM.

637
00:26:23,619 --> 00:26:25,139
He walked and walked,

638
00:26:26,379 --> 00:26:28,180
all the way to town for class.

639
00:26:28,660 --> 00:26:29,940
He just kept walking,

640
00:26:31,299 --> 00:26:32,740
from fields to the city,

641
00:26:34,139 --> 00:26:35,740
from dirt roads to paved streets,

642
00:26:36,220 --> 00:26:37,460
from having nothing at all

643
00:26:38,099 --> 00:26:39,299
to running a factory.

644
00:26:40,500 --> 00:26:41,579
He always told me

645
00:26:43,579 --> 00:26:45,220
it doesn't matter
if it's still dark out.

646
00:26:47,299 --> 00:26:48,099
If you keep walking,

647
00:26:49,660 --> 00:26:50,379
dawn will break.

648
00:26:53,020 --> 00:26:53,940
(So I think)

649
00:26:54,339 --> 00:26:56,700
(sunrise doesn't always mean light.)

650
00:26:57,660 --> 00:26:58,379
(The sun is)

651
00:26:58,379 --> 00:26:59,539
(just a morning star.)

652
00:27:00,379 --> 00:27:01,859
(Only when we're truly awake)

653
00:27:02,740 --> 00:27:03,940
(does dawn actually arrive.)

654
00:27:05,059 --> 00:27:07,379
(Lu Hui)
The subscriber you dialed

655
00:27:07,379 --> 00:27:08,619
is currently unavailable.

656
00:27:09,020 --> 00:27:10,180
Please try again later.

657
00:27:12,500 --> 00:27:14,740
Sorry, the subscriber you dialed

658
00:27:14,819 --> 00:27:15,900
is currently unavailable.

659
00:27:16,260 --> 00:27:17,420
Please try again later.

660
00:27:22,500 --> 00:27:23,099
Why is it you?
Waiting for whom?

661
00:27:25,220 --> 00:27:25,980
Meng, I suppose.

662
00:27:26,980 --> 00:27:27,700
Not your business.

663
00:27:29,180 --> 00:27:29,740
Why come here?
I know it all.

664
00:27:31,020 --> 00:27:31,539
About what?
My mom's application

665
00:27:32,500 --> 00:27:33,139
fell through.

666
00:27:34,020 --> 00:27:34,740
Was it your doing?

667
00:27:35,339 --> 00:27:36,020
She told you?

668
00:27:36,180 --> 00:27:37,139
Nobody told me.
I know everything.

669
00:27:40,059 --> 00:27:40,420
Dad,

670
00:27:41,139 --> 00:27:42,220
this money isn't yours.

671
00:27:42,539 --> 00:27:43,339
This is a crime!

672
00:27:44,059 --> 00:27:44,740
I can't let you
go to prison.

673
00:27:45,900 --> 00:27:46,995
I'll give you all my money.

674
00:27:47,180 --> 00:27:48,181
You give it back to Meng.

675
00:27:48,299 --> 00:27:49,539
That's not true.

676
00:27:50,020 --> 00:27:51,020
It's complete nonsense.

677
00:27:51,500 --> 00:27:52,020
I have proof.

678
00:27:55,500 --> 00:27:55,980
I stole this

679
00:27:56,260 --> 00:27:57,339
from Jiao Xu's

680
00:27:57,339 --> 00:27:57,859
computer.

681
00:27:58,740 --> 00:27:59,859
I wiped his computer clean.

682
00:28:00,619 --> 00:28:01,579
Only I have the proof.

683
00:28:01,859 --> 00:28:02,260
Dad,

684
00:28:03,379 --> 00:28:04,859
promise me to stop now,

685
00:28:06,139 --> 00:28:06,740
you'll have it.

686
00:28:09,339 --> 00:28:10,260
No need to show me.

687
00:28:11,099 --> 00:28:12,220
I know what's on it.

688
00:28:13,500 --> 00:28:14,059
You do?

689
00:28:17,180 --> 00:28:18,980
It's just part of our divorce battle.

690
00:28:20,099 --> 00:28:20,940
I knew

691
00:28:21,660 --> 00:28:22,900
Jiao Xu would pull this trick.

692
00:28:23,819 --> 00:28:24,779
But I just didn't expect

693
00:28:25,740 --> 00:28:26,700
Yu Meng would agree.

694
00:28:33,059 --> 00:28:34,220
When money is involved,

695
00:28:34,900 --> 00:28:36,339
people's motives get ugly.

696
00:28:36,940 --> 00:28:37,700
I did no crime.

697
00:28:38,740 --> 00:28:39,260
They're not
going to sue me.

698
00:28:41,180 --> 00:28:42,059
Everything on this
is fake.

699
00:28:43,539 --> 00:28:44,539
They're just trying

700
00:28:44,700 --> 00:28:46,220
to force me to divorce early.

701
00:28:47,339 --> 00:28:48,339
But I saw...

702
00:28:48,460 --> 00:28:49,539
It's all fake.

703
00:28:56,819 --> 00:28:57,660
I'm sorry, Dad.

704
00:28:58,099 --> 00:28:58,940
I was too reckless.

705
00:29:00,460 --> 00:29:00,819
I...

706
00:29:01,539 --> 00:29:02,819
I didn't want you to be in jail.

707
00:29:03,260 --> 00:29:04,020
It's all my fault.

708
00:29:05,579 --> 00:29:07,099
I should've handled the divorce well,

709
00:29:07,700 --> 00:29:08,339
to avoid them
dragging you into this.

710
00:29:11,500 --> 00:29:11,940
Well,

711
00:29:14,099 --> 00:29:14,980
give me the USB.

712
00:29:15,740 --> 00:29:16,579
Jiao Xu will

713
00:29:17,099 --> 00:29:17,900
figure out soon

714
00:29:18,059 --> 00:29:18,940
that you tampered his computer.

715
00:29:19,099 --> 00:29:20,260
You'll just insist

716
00:29:20,539 --> 00:29:21,139
you're innocent.

717
00:29:21,819 --> 00:29:23,660
I'll take all the fall.

718
00:29:29,339 --> 00:29:29,859
What?

719
00:29:30,420 --> 00:29:31,180
Don't trust me?

720
00:29:31,500 --> 00:29:31,980
Have you two
agreed on the divorce terms?

721
00:29:35,579 --> 00:29:35,980
Almost.

722
00:29:37,099 --> 00:29:38,220
Tell me everything

723
00:29:38,819 --> 00:29:39,700
in divorcing my mom

724
00:29:40,220 --> 00:29:41,139
and marrying Meng,
and then

725
00:29:42,740 --> 00:29:43,339
you'll have it.

726
00:29:44,059 --> 00:29:44,619
No problem.

727
00:29:45,420 --> 00:29:46,460
But not today.

728
00:29:47,099 --> 00:29:47,700
I got a meeting
coming.

729
00:29:49,180 --> 00:29:49,900
Once I wrap up,

730
00:29:50,700 --> 00:29:51,779
the three of us will

731
00:29:51,940 --> 00:29:52,619
have dinner,

732
00:29:53,660 --> 00:29:54,379
and I'll tell you.

733
00:30:01,539 --> 00:30:02,420
Home! Go home!
Alright.

734
00:30:03,420 --> 00:30:04,059
Okay, go home.
What's going on?

735
00:30:05,099 --> 00:30:05,740
Let's go home.

736
00:30:06,180 --> 00:30:07,339
She's always like this.

737
00:30:07,579 --> 00:30:08,940
She insists on leaving,

738
00:30:09,420 --> 00:30:10,500
but her illness forbids.

739
00:30:11,740 --> 00:30:13,059
You have to promise me,

740
00:30:14,020 --> 00:30:14,740
once you get home,

741
00:30:15,500 --> 00:30:16,539
you won't hurt yourself

742
00:30:16,980 --> 00:30:17,779
or anyone else.

743
00:30:18,900 --> 00:30:19,299
Remember?

744
00:30:19,379 --> 00:30:20,500
Last time I took you home,

745
00:30:21,180 --> 00:30:21,660
that night,
you dropped

746
00:30:22,700 --> 00:30:23,619
a flowerpot

747
00:30:23,779 --> 00:30:24,859
and hurt Yue.

748
00:30:25,819 --> 00:30:27,260
I wouldn't hurt Yue.

749
00:30:27,660 --> 00:30:28,299
I didn't!

750
00:30:28,619 --> 00:30:29,859
Of course, you don't remember.

751
00:30:29,859 --> 00:30:30,980
Because you're sick.

752
00:30:32,260 --> 00:30:32,579
But

753
00:30:33,539 --> 00:30:34,059
that's okay.
You...

754
00:30:35,420 --> 00:30:36,220
You want to go home,

755
00:30:37,020 --> 00:30:38,619
then I'll take you home.

756
00:30:39,139 --> 00:30:40,139
Okay? If you

757
00:30:41,299 --> 00:30:43,139
feel unwell or upset again,

758
00:30:43,460 --> 00:30:43,940
I'll

759
00:30:44,579 --> 00:30:45,700
stay upstairs with you.

760
00:30:47,700 --> 00:30:48,900
Just as the usual.

761
00:30:49,579 --> 00:30:51,139
The two of us

762
00:30:51,460 --> 00:30:52,139
stay in the room,
okay?

763
00:30:52,819 --> 00:30:54,260
No, I don't want to!

764
00:30:55,539 --> 00:30:56,260
No, I don't.

765
00:30:56,940 --> 00:30:58,539
I-I'm not going home.

766
00:30:59,220 --> 00:31:00,700
There, there. Let me hug you.

767
00:31:04,299 --> 00:31:05,740
You are the best girl.

768
00:31:06,940 --> 00:31:07,859
I love you the most.

769
00:31:11,059 --> 00:31:11,579
Come in.

770
00:31:13,819 --> 00:31:14,220
Doctor,

771
00:31:14,700 --> 00:31:16,059
the patient in Bed Three, Ward 205,

772
00:31:16,220 --> 00:31:17,020
is losing control.

773
00:31:17,180 --> 00:31:18,139
Could you check on her?

774
00:31:18,900 --> 00:31:19,260
Okay.

775
00:31:19,779 --> 00:31:20,619
I'll go right now.

776
00:31:32,768 --> 00:31:33,901
(Patient Medication Record)

777
00:31:36,893 --> 00:31:37,913
(Schizophrenia, Anxiety)

778
00:31:37,913 --> 00:31:40,377
(Patient stupor alleviated. Able to eat independently.
Psychiatric symptoms improved.)

779
00:31:42,376 --> 00:31:44,578
(Patient psychiatric symptoms improved.
Sleep schedule gradually normalized.)

780
00:31:47,437 --> 00:31:49,505
(Patient's reactive psychosis symptoms
fluctuate significantly)

781
00:31:59,327 --> 00:32:00,059
(Jiangzhou Zhenyi
Convalescent & Wellness Center)

782
00:32:00,059 --> 00:32:01,539
Weng Xin might be overmedicated?

783
00:32:02,779 --> 00:32:03,139
I consulted

784
00:32:03,260 --> 00:32:04,420
a psychiatrist.

785
00:32:04,940 --> 00:32:05,619
Since she started

786
00:32:05,779 --> 00:32:06,819
treatment five years ago,

787
00:32:06,980 --> 00:32:07,579
her dosage

788
00:32:07,740 --> 00:32:08,740
has been higher than that

789
00:32:09,379 --> 00:32:09,980
of other patients.

790
00:32:10,299 --> 00:32:11,379
Although we don't know

791
00:32:11,379 --> 00:32:12,180
how she developed

792
00:32:12,339 --> 00:32:13,460
reactive psychosis,

793
00:32:14,099 --> 00:32:15,180
this kind of dosage

794
00:32:15,740 --> 00:32:17,099
is worsening her condition.

795
00:32:17,740 --> 00:32:18,819
The year she was diagnosed,

796
00:32:19,379 --> 00:32:20,420
I was studying abroad.

797
00:32:21,379 --> 00:32:22,539
They didn't want me to worry,

798
00:32:22,619 --> 00:32:23,379
and hid it from me.

799
00:32:24,059 --> 00:32:25,539
I only found out after returning,

800
00:32:26,099 --> 00:32:28,299
and she was already critically ill
and hospitalized.

801
00:32:28,740 --> 00:32:29,660
Thinking back now,

802
00:32:30,420 --> 00:32:31,180
it was Han Guang
who told my parents

803
00:32:33,020 --> 00:32:33,859
to hid it from me.

804
00:32:37,579 --> 00:32:38,740
How is she doing now?

805
00:32:38,980 --> 00:32:40,260
Han Guang is good at

806
00:32:40,339 --> 00:32:41,020
mental control.

807
00:32:41,660 --> 00:32:42,660
Whenever he visits,

808
00:32:43,139 --> 00:32:44,460
Weng Xin gets extremely agitated.

809
00:32:45,420 --> 00:32:46,619
But she's usually very quiet,

810
00:32:47,339 --> 00:32:48,260
unless

811
00:32:49,420 --> 00:32:50,500
she's having nightmares.

812
00:32:52,420 --> 00:32:54,139
She had nightmares
at home sometimes too.

813
00:32:55,579 --> 00:32:56,460
Once on my night duty,
her episode hit.

814
00:32:58,099 --> 00:32:58,940
She insisted on

815
00:32:59,859 --> 00:33:01,900
going to the US to see her child.

816
00:33:02,500 --> 00:33:03,980
She said her son is still

817
00:33:04,180 --> 00:33:04,859
in kindergarten.

818
00:33:05,099 --> 00:33:06,099
But she and Han Guang

819
00:33:06,299 --> 00:33:07,420
never had any children.

820
00:33:08,619 --> 00:33:09,940
Take her for a reevaluation.

821
00:33:10,299 --> 00:33:11,299
Overdose might cause

822
00:33:11,460 --> 00:33:12,260
the hallucinations.

823
00:33:15,619 --> 00:33:16,500
Can I see her?

824
00:33:16,819 --> 00:33:17,460
Better not.

825
00:33:17,980 --> 00:33:18,940
Han Guang is close with

826
00:33:19,059 --> 00:33:19,819
the staff there.

827
00:33:20,819 --> 00:33:22,099
Even if I get you in,

828
00:33:22,819 --> 00:33:23,980
he'll probably find out.

829
00:33:24,460 --> 00:33:25,339
That'll cause trouble.

830
00:33:26,819 --> 00:33:28,020
I'm just a little worried.

831
00:33:28,660 --> 00:33:29,339
If her memory

832
00:33:29,339 --> 00:33:30,819
is so disordered...

833
00:33:30,940 --> 00:33:31,779
Anything she says

834
00:33:35,059 --> 00:33:36,220
will be even harder

835
00:33:36,819 --> 00:33:37,579
to convince anyone.

836
00:33:40,260 --> 00:33:41,139
About today,

837
00:33:42,379 --> 00:33:42,980
thank you.

838
00:33:44,339 --> 00:33:45,420
If not for you,

839
00:33:45,940 --> 00:33:46,779
I might have missed
the best window

840
00:33:47,740 --> 00:33:48,579
to get Xin cure.

841
00:33:49,420 --> 00:33:50,619
You should thank Ms. Hui too.

842
00:33:52,539 --> 00:33:52,940
Right.

843
00:33:54,099 --> 00:33:55,619
Lu Hui is...

844
00:33:57,420 --> 00:33:57,859
Exactly.

845
00:33:58,500 --> 00:33:59,579
My parents' housekeeper

846
00:34:00,020 --> 00:34:00,859
and my husband's ex.

847
00:34:04,980 --> 00:34:06,220
You are truly amazing.

848
00:34:08,900 --> 00:34:10,020
What's there to praise?

849
00:34:10,420 --> 00:34:11,179
I mean it.

850
00:34:12,219 --> 00:34:12,900
To be honest,

851
00:34:13,219 --> 00:34:14,380
I really hated you at first.

852
00:34:15,739 --> 00:34:16,820
I've seen your posts.

853
00:34:17,259 --> 00:34:17,780
To me,
you were the trophy wife

854
00:34:18,820 --> 00:34:19,579
I hated the most,

855
00:34:19,980 --> 00:34:20,900
always mentioning
your husband.

856
00:34:22,699 --> 00:34:23,699
You even thought I was having an affair

857
00:34:23,739 --> 00:34:24,259
with him.

858
00:34:26,500 --> 00:34:27,539
Don't blame me for this.

859
00:34:28,020 --> 00:34:28,980
He's such an actor.

860
00:34:29,739 --> 00:34:30,500
I didn't realize

861
00:34:30,659 --> 00:34:31,619
he's trash.

862
00:34:32,219 --> 00:34:32,539
True.

863
00:34:33,300 --> 00:34:34,579
And I hate you act coyly

864
00:34:34,579 --> 00:34:35,020
toward
everyone

865
00:34:35,780 --> 00:34:36,539
and everything.

866
00:34:37,699 --> 00:34:38,860
Because I've always believed

867
00:34:39,219 --> 00:34:40,539
it doesn't solve anything.

868
00:34:41,219 --> 00:34:42,780
So I rarely

869
00:34:43,219 --> 00:34:44,179
act coyly.

870
00:34:45,259 --> 00:34:46,780
But later I realized

871
00:34:48,259 --> 00:34:49,099
deep down,

872
00:34:49,259 --> 00:34:50,259
you're really tough.

873
00:34:51,059 --> 00:34:51,659
You act coyly,

874
00:34:51,900 --> 00:34:52,739
but you're not weak.

875
00:34:53,219 --> 00:34:54,460
When you fall, you get back up,

876
00:34:54,619 --> 00:34:55,900
